Backport of GCC commits 619a5e5586759a3ed16baf1333728664b06b0451 and
f92e603f22924348b005d2acdebfda8a2c159773 (PR driver/111527).

The gcc/doc/invoke.texi hunk is omitted because the Environment Variables
section moved between supported release branches. The implementation, host
configuration documentation, and regression test are unchanged from upstream.

diff --git a/gcc/collect-utils.cc b/gcc/collect-utils.cc
